WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.071
One grade. Three parts.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:08.802
Every analysis gets a technique grade out of one hundred. It scores pull under, bar path and rhythm.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:15.165
Then the rules are checked, one by one. Each rule is listed with its number.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.612
When the view is not clear, those rules are marked not checked. The grade then rests on the bar alone.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:29.522
The referee lights follow the competition rules. If it cannot see you clearly, it says so.

00:00:29.967 --> 00:00:34.286
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
